    {
      "claim_id": "P-integral-x3-x",
      "statement": "The polynomial P in Q[x] satisfying P(0)=0 and P'(x)=x^3 - x is P(x) = x^4/4 - x^2/2, i.e. coefficients (c0,c1,c2,c3,c4) = (0,0,-1/2,0,1/4).",
